  "method": [
    "Mix the dough as listed, following each ingredient's note (late additions, salt timing). Let it ferment 60 min, fold, 18–20 h cold, ≥4 h room.",
    "Let dough rest at room temperature for at least 4 hours. Break off 44 long pieces of dough of 600 g, place on trays finely sprinkled with rye meal and let ferment well.",
    "Twist shaped pieces, make ring shapes, place on the loading peel and let relax briefly.",
    "Bake in hot oven with steam, Open vent after 20 minutes and finish off baking until crisp."
